WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.996
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.266 --> 01:41.935
[Episode 14]

3
01:50.433 --> 01:51.653
Have you made up your mind?

4
01:52.659 --> 01:54.719
I'm already here.

5
01:54.719 --> 01:56.846
When will you release Jiang Xue Ting?

6
02:01.480 --> 02:05.519
Releasing a suspect like him won't be easy.

7
02:05.519 --> 02:07.160
The evidence is solid.

8
02:07.160 --> 02:08.886
There are procedures to follow.

9
02:09.640 --> 02:12.273
But I am a man of my word.

10
02:13.320 --> 02:15.013
He will come back alive.

11
02:17.680 --> 02:18.853
Alright.

12
02:20.120 --> 02:21.666
Then let's begin.

13
02:57.320 --> 03:00.880
What? You don't want to do this here?

14
03:01.520 --> 03:03.286
Then where do you want to do it?

15
03:21.400 --> 03:27.200
You'd really go this far for him?

16
03:28.280 --> 03:29.526
Yes.

17
03:33.040 --> 03:34.860
Isn't this what you wanted?

18
03:42.300 --> 03:43.473
Fine.

19
03:44.600 --> 03:46.193
I'll give you what you want.

20
04:03.160 --> 04:06.760
Weren't you just offering yourself to me? What?

21
04:08.240 --> 04:10.120
You've changed your mind?

22
05:14.880 --> 05:17.186
Try to be more professional next time.

23
05:19.160 --> 05:24.740
I want this deal quick and clean, not tragic.

24
06:38.200 --> 06:39.720
What exactly do you want?

25
06:40.339 --> 06:42.500
What is it that I can't give you?

26
06:42.500 --> 06:44.319
I want pure love.

27
06:45.200 --> 06:49.253
A love with equality, respect, and devotion.

28
07:51.360 --> 07:54.800
I will never let you marry someone else.

29
07:55.779 --> 07:57.639
Ye Ping Jun.

30
07:59.779 --> 08:02.060
Ye Ping Jun.

31
08:03.740 --> 08:05.513
Ping Jun...

32
08:21.760 --> 08:24.360
What's wrong? Why are you crying?

33
08:24.360 --> 08:26.800
You're about to go onstage.

34
08:26.800 --> 08:29.280
You can't cry before they do your makeup.

35
08:58.519 --> 09:04.159
- Bravo! - Bravo!

36
09:20.200 --> 09:23.460
I saw it ages ago. That girl is quite something.

37
09:23.460 --> 09:27.760
Not like a certain someone, wasted years waiting,

38
09:27.760 --> 09:32.281
only to end up as a little plaything to keep others amused.

39
09:33.639 --> 09:35.480
How could Lan Qing turn out like this?

40
09:35.480 --> 09:37.019
- Yes. - She shouldn't have.

41
09:37.019 --> 09:38.059
What happened?

42
09:38.059 --> 09:39.759
You're not singing?

43
09:39.759 --> 09:40.919
Sing. Why did you stop?

44
09:40.919 --> 09:42.460
Your voice went dead.

45
09:42.460 --> 09:46.460
Not like a certain someone, wasted years waiting,

46
09:46.460 --> 09:50.820
only to end up as a little plaything to keep others amused.

47
09:50.820 --> 09:52.855
- Keep singing. - What the hell is going on?

48
09:52.855 --> 09:54.220
- Are you singing or not? - Refunds!

49
09:54.220 --> 09:55.519
- Refunds! - Sing!

50
09:55.519 --> 09:56.740
Refunds. Get off the stage.

51
09:56.740 --> 09:57.960
Refunds.

52
10:03.559 --> 10:05.197
Refunds.

53
10:05.197 --> 10:07.039
Refunds.

54
10:07.039 --> 10:09.860
You caused a disaster. Get off the stage.

55
10:11.639 --> 10:13.240
Everyone.

56
10:13.240 --> 10:14.519
Everyone.

57
10:14.519 --> 10:16.340
Sorry, everyone.

58
10:21.519 --> 10:23.000
Faster.

59
10:23.000 --> 10:24.000
Careful.

60
10:24.000 --> 10:25.840
Don't make another mistake.

61
10:27.880 --> 10:30.577
You're a dud. Watch me.

62
10:30.577 --> 10:32.559
Please stop talking.

63
10:32.559 --> 10:36.320
We're counting on you to carry tonight's show.

64
10:40.520 --> 10:42.990
You're usually the star of the show.

65
10:42.990 --> 10:44.760
But you blew it tonight.

66
10:44.760 --> 10:47.019
Let's see how cocky you are from now on.

67
10:47.019 --> 10:48.860
You're only fit to be a stepping stone.

68
10:48.860 --> 10:51.039
Okay. Hurry.

69
10:51.039 --> 10:52.860
Help Tao Chun onto the stage.

70
10:52.860 --> 10:54.520
Hold her steady.

71
11:07.379 --> 11:08.560
Lan Qing.

72
11:08.560 --> 11:12.104
Xiao Tao Chun also plays young women.

73
11:12.104 --> 11:13.663
She knows this opera too.

74
11:14.340 --> 11:19.233
Why don't we take a few days off and stage another opera?

75
11:35.880 --> 11:37.640
Take off your hat.

76
11:47.320 --> 11:48.360
Master Chang Xuan.

77
11:48.360 --> 11:50.000
All checkpoints are secured.

78
11:50.000 --> 11:52.680
Shang Hong Wen can't possibly leave Nanhuai.

79
11:52.680 --> 11:53.984
Keep a close watch.

80
11:53.984 --> 11:56.740
Now we just wait for that slippery eel to show himself.

81
11:56.740 --> 11:57.826
Yes.

82
12:01.320 --> 12:02.360
Master Chang Xuan.

83
12:02.360 --> 12:05.749
Are we heading home to the mansion, Xiangxi Hotel, or Maple Mansion?

84
12:05.749 --> 12:06.880
Maple Mansion.

85
12:06.880 --> 12:07.880
Yes.

86
13:26.220 --> 13:27.820
You hurt me.

87
13:38.480 --> 13:40.363
I bought you all these clothes.

88
13:40.363 --> 13:42.220
Why don't you wear them?

89
13:42.220 --> 13:45.346
And you don't like the jewelry either?

90
13:48.000 --> 13:49.000
Here's what we'll do.

91
13:49.572 --> 13:51.960
I'll have Bo Wen take you to the department store.

92
13:51.960 --> 13:54.540
Buy whatever you like.

93
13:56.560 --> 13:59.879
I won't go with her. And I won't go.

94
14:01.980 --> 14:03.953
You don't have to hate her this much.

95
14:06.399 --> 14:08.759
Do you expect me to thank her profusely?

96
14:25.280 --> 14:27.817
You never practice.

97
14:27.817 --> 14:32.600
Your teacher's testing you soon. So you're cramming while you can.

98
14:32.600 --> 14:35.200
Mom, all you do is criticize me.

99
14:35.200 --> 14:37.280
You have time for this? Why not say something about Chang Xuan?

100
14:37.280 --> 14:39.080
He leaves early and comes home late.

101
14:39.080 --> 14:41.564
Who knows what he's busy with?

102
14:41.564 --> 14:43.400
True.

103
14:43.400 --> 14:44.870
Speaking of which,

104
14:44.870 --> 14:48.240
Chang Xuan hasn't been home for dinner for days.

105
14:48.240 --> 14:52.199
I heard from Zhou Tai that he's been going to Maple Mansion a lot lately.

106
14:55.516 --> 14:57.320
Zhou Tai.

107
14:57.320 --> 15:00.280
What has Chang Xuan been doing at Maple Mansion lately?

108
15:00.280 --> 15:03.360
Madam, I don't know the details.

109
15:03.360 --> 15:05.700
I only know that Master Chang Xuan sent a cook there.

110
15:05.700 --> 15:08.840
He's also carefully arranged everything for day-to-day needs.

111
15:10.800 --> 15:13.820
Still, Maple Mansion is especially beautiful this time of year.

112
15:13.820 --> 15:16.360
Perhaps Chang Xuan wants to work there.

113
15:18.080 --> 15:21.720
I often ask him to stay there with me for a couple of days.

114
15:21.720 --> 15:24.760
He always says he's too busy with military affairs.

115
15:24.760 --> 15:27.379
He says it's too quiet there.

116
15:27.379 --> 15:29.580
He doesn't seem to mind the quiet now.

117
15:32.880 --> 15:34.760
Keep playing the piano!

118
15:35.520 --> 15:36.680
I know.

119
15:45.200 --> 15:46.744
It's so late.

120
15:46.744 --> 15:50.406
And you actually have time to practice calligraphy here.

121
15:54.920 --> 15:58.086
Then do you have time for anything else?

122
16:06.360 --> 16:10.580
They say my handwriting is bold and crisp.

123
16:10.580 --> 16:14.299
But it could use a touch more grace and warmth.

124
16:15.040 --> 16:17.379
Your small-script calligraphy is lovely.

125
16:17.379 --> 16:18.840
Why don't you teach me?

126
16:19.560 --> 16:20.720
No.

127
16:20.720 --> 16:22.397
My handwriting isn't fit to show in public.

128
16:22.397 --> 16:25.126
You'd better find someone else.

129
16:32.560 --> 16:37.153
If you want to save Jiang Xue Ting, show some sincerity.

130
16:38.520 --> 16:42.280
You won't serve me, and you won't teach me to write.

131
16:43.240 --> 16:46.040
What, should you just sit here looking pretty?

132
17:17.960 --> 17:20.620
Is this how you teach someone to write?

133
17:24.720 --> 17:27.360
They say small script is like a man.

134
17:27.360 --> 17:30.493
Every stroke is neat and precise.

135
17:31.120 --> 17:33.660
But I think small script is like a woman.

136
17:34.320 --> 17:36.360
It's delicate and full of variation.

137
17:38.200 --> 17:44.200
The finer details make it all the more beautiful.

138
18:02.019 --> 18:04.319
My courtyard is full of maple trees.

139
18:05.480 --> 18:11.960
By late autumn, the red leaves will blanket the hills.

140
18:11.960 --> 18:14.360
That's why it's called Maple Mansion.

141
18:14.360 --> 18:17.786
[The Maple Leaf Promise] When the leaves turn red,

142
18:18.687 --> 18:20.460
I'll watch them with you.

143
18:26.520 --> 18:28.840
Your handwriting is truly excellent.

144
18:28.840 --> 18:31.106
I don't think there's anything left for me to teach you.

145
18:37.080 --> 18:39.979
It's too dark. Bring the candle closer.

146
18:57.360 --> 18:58.721
What are you doing?

147
19:00.040 --> 19:03.913
I hear your teachers at school are always praising you.

148
19:04.600 --> 19:06.600
I wanted to ask you something.

149
19:06.600 --> 19:12.440
What's the line before "the moon casts a shadow on fragrant flowers"?

150
19:19.360 --> 19:20.806
I don't remember.

151
19:24.840 --> 19:26.420
How could you forget?

152
19:28.559 --> 19:33.980
"A spring night's hour is worth a thousand gold."

153
19:39.400 --> 19:40.779
Give me back the ring.

154
20:00.779 --> 20:02.099
Yu Chang Xuan.

155
20:04.240 --> 20:07.960
Remember this: I'll hate you for the rest of my life.

156
20:14.167 --> 20:15.546
Ye Ping Jun.

157
20:15.546 --> 20:16.906
You remember this, too.

158
20:17.680 --> 20:23.041
From now on, not a trace of another man is to be found on you.

159
20:37.640 --> 20:38.900
I see.

160
20:39.840 --> 20:41.160
Excuse me.

161
20:45.840 --> 20:47.839
What did the people at the Yu Mansion say?

162
20:47.839 --> 20:51.240
They said that Master Chang Xuan hasn't returned home.

163
20:51.240 --> 20:53.700
He went straight to the Maple Mansion office again today.

164
20:57.200 --> 20:58.773
You may leave.

165
20:59.640 --> 21:00.940
Yes.

166
21:17.380 --> 21:19.819
Work hard and make something of yourself.

167
21:19.819 --> 21:24.640
Don't let another man lay a hand on your girlfriend again.

168
21:29.779 --> 21:31.000
Zi Yi.

169
21:31.000 --> 21:35.080
Who could have known? How could such a serious accident happen?

170
21:35.080 --> 21:39.460
Whoever is taken hostage today, Chang Xuan will step up.

171
21:39.460 --> 21:44.980
But I'm also happy my boyfriend can be so dependable.

172
21:47.440 --> 21:51.720
Chang Xuan is lucky to have you.

173
22:02.940 --> 22:05.960
Miss, don't hurt yourself.

174
22:28.480 --> 22:31.500
Call the Yu family.

175
22:31.500 --> 22:35.619
Tell them I'll visit Madam tomorrow.

176
22:36.700 --> 22:37.900
Yes.

177
23:43.099 --> 23:46.680
You've been reading ever since you went to prison?

178
23:47.359 --> 23:50.006
You're a breath of fresh air among prisoners.

179
23:51.519 --> 23:52.900
I want to know that, too.

180
23:54.039 --> 23:58.539
Why didn't you have me shot as planned?

181
23:58.539 --> 24:04.259
Because you were only a minor player in the whole affair.

182
24:10.519 --> 24:14.400
Looks like you know everything already.

183
24:21.900 --> 24:25.900
You won't kill me, but you keep me here.

184
24:26.880 --> 24:28.660
What are you trying to accomplish?

185
24:30.900 --> 24:32.680
What is my purpose?

186
24:33.920 --> 24:35.513
You really don't know?

187
24:37.480 --> 24:38.819
Yu Chang Xuan!

188
24:46.480 --> 24:49.360
If you dare threaten Ping Jun with my life,

189
24:49.360 --> 24:52.280
as long as I get the chance to walk out alive,

190
24:52.280 --> 24:54.280
I'll kill you.

191
24:57.400 --> 24:59.400
I believe you have the guts.

192
24:59.400 --> 25:04.279
But you'll never have the power.

193
25:14.200 --> 25:15.480
Yu Chang Xuan.

194
25:17.040 --> 25:21.619
If you're a man, don't use such despicable tactics to threaten Ping Jun.

195
25:21.619 --> 25:26.160
Knowing her, you'll never win her heart this way.

196
25:26.160 --> 25:27.839
What gives you the right?

197
25:29.680 --> 25:31.919
Did you ever tell her what you did?

198
25:33.140 --> 25:37.260
Did you ever worry you'd drag her into this and put her in danger?

199
25:38.819 --> 25:43.220
You want to be a spy and marry her, too.

200
25:44.279 --> 25:46.193
You call that caring about her?

201
25:59.680 --> 26:01.519
Even if I have no right,

202
26:03.320 --> 26:05.733
you could never be the one she ends up with.

203
26:07.220 --> 26:12.559
You're a warlord with nothing in your heart but conquest and possession.

204
26:13.460 --> 26:15.359
You will only hurt her.

205
26:18.539 --> 26:20.000
You're wrong.

206
26:22.980 --> 26:25.539
I can give her everything she wants.

207
26:29.119 --> 26:32.579
And I want you to see it clearly.

208
26:33.380 --> 26:37.726
How she truly chooses to stay by my side.

209
26:42.740 --> 26:44.240
Yu Chang Xuan.

210
26:46.559 --> 26:48.660
You stop at nothing.

211
26:50.099 --> 26:51.980
You will go to hell.

212
26:54.220 --> 26:59.259
With Ping Jun by my side, how could I go to hell?

213
27:25.440 --> 27:26.599
Master Chang Xuan.

214
27:26.599 --> 27:28.650
Should we proceed according to the original plan?

215
27:28.650 --> 27:30.240
As planned.

216
27:30.240 --> 27:32.440
Publish the news of the traitor's execution.

217
27:32.440 --> 27:34.319
Open Qingshan Ferry Terminal.

218
27:34.319 --> 27:37.664
Monitor it in secret and wait for Shang Hong Wen to take the bait.

219
27:37.664 --> 27:38.680
Yes.

220
27:38.680 --> 27:42.980
By the way. Madam called today and asked you to return to the residence.

221
27:47.339 --> 27:48.740
Miss Ye.

222
27:49.640 --> 27:52.160
Miss Ye. You haven't eaten or drunk anything today.

223
27:52.160 --> 27:54.099
You've been searching here for hours.

224
27:54.099 --> 27:56.760
You'll make yourself sick if you keep this up.

225
27:58.273 --> 28:00.039
- Leave me alone. - That's not acceptable.

226
28:00.039 --> 28:02.279
Master Chang Xuan specifically told me to take good care of you.

227
28:02.279 --> 28:04.286
You must not come to any harm.

228
28:23.640 --> 28:25.066
Miss Ye.

229
28:25.920 --> 28:27.873
Careful, Miss Ye.

230
28:34.400 --> 28:36.160
Miss Ye, you mustn't do that.

231
28:36.160 --> 28:38.520
What if you catch a chill?

232
28:38.520 --> 28:41.713
Miss Ye, please come up. You'll catch a cold.

233
28:43.940 --> 28:46.240
Miss Ye, you're hurt.

234
28:46.856 --> 28:48.940
Miss Ye, stop looking.

235
28:48.940 --> 28:50.640
Please get up.

236
28:59.880 --> 29:01.240
I found it.

237
29:08.920 --> 29:11.120
Zi Yi, that was thoughtful of you.

238
29:11.120 --> 29:14.440
You came to keep me company.

239
29:14.440 --> 29:17.580
Mom, she didn't come to keep you company.

240
29:17.580 --> 29:20.779
She came to catch Chang Xuan.

241
29:22.279 --> 29:25.240
But I don't know what's gotten into Chang Xuan lately.

242
29:25.240 --> 29:26.420
He's hardly ever home.

243
29:26.420 --> 29:28.519
What are you talking about?

244
29:28.519 --> 29:31.240
Chang Xuan's been swamped with official business.

245
29:31.240 --> 29:33.279
Stop covering for him.

246
29:33.279 --> 29:36.793
At this rate, anyone would think he's keeping a mistress.

247
29:49.520 --> 29:52.360
What are you saying behind my back, Yu Qi Xuan?

248
29:52.360 --> 29:54.820
Yu Chang Xuan, don't touch my head.

249
29:55.520 --> 29:58.633
Here comes the man who'll settle the score. You guys play. I'm done.

250
30:00.779 --> 30:03.039
You play. I'm going to report to Father.

251
30:03.039 --> 30:04.800
What's gotten into you?

252
30:04.800 --> 30:07.240
It took me forever to put this game together.

253
30:07.240 --> 30:10.217
You show up and ruin it. Now we're one player short.

254
30:10.217 --> 30:12.819
Where am I supposed to find someone now?

255
30:12.819 --> 30:14.113
Sit down.

256
30:16.160 --> 30:20.220
You wouldn't happen to think I'm a lousy player and no fun to play with?

257
30:20.220 --> 30:21.740
Of course not.

258
30:21.740 --> 30:24.986
I'm afraid you're too good. I can't afford to lose.

259
30:28.080 --> 30:30.400
Look at you two.

260
30:30.400 --> 30:33.440
I have one rule when we play here.

261
30:33.440 --> 30:37.280
No secret flirting.

262
30:37.280 --> 30:40.204
We're only playing a few rounds to pass the time.

263
30:40.204 --> 30:42.800
If your dad gives you trouble, I'll talk to him.

264
30:42.800 --> 30:44.197
Sit.

265
30:44.197 --> 30:45.513
Okay.

266
30:48.680 --> 30:50.013
Your turn.

267
30:54.260 --> 30:55.299
Eight Bamboos.

268
30:55.299 --> 30:56.640
Peng.

269
31:13.579 --> 31:15.240
I have Nine Bamboos, too.

270
31:17.539 --> 31:18.960
South Wind.

271
31:23.013 --> 31:24.120
Three Character.

272
31:24.120 --> 31:25.410
Mahjong.

273
31:25.410 --> 31:26.733
That was fast.

274
31:30.400 --> 31:31.720
Chang Xuan.

275
31:31.720 --> 31:34.773
Are you afraid to win in front of Zi Yi?

276
31:35.840 --> 31:38.640
Forget it. I'm unlucky. You play.

277
31:38.640 --> 31:41.299
I'll go report to Father before he starts in on me.

278
31:46.760 --> 31:51.777
Men, it seems, really do need to start a family before building a career.

279
31:51.777 --> 31:56.059
He's about to get married, and he's becoming more sensible by the day.

280
31:56.059 --> 31:59.299
He's taking military affairs more seriously.

281
32:02.779 --> 32:06.960
Auntie, why not call Min Ru over for a few rounds?

282
32:06.960 --> 32:08.140
Sure.

283
32:08.140 --> 32:09.559
Go get Min Ru.

284
32:09.559 --> 32:11.140
Yes, Madam.

285
32:11.140 --> 32:12.693
Wait for her.

286
32:35.840 --> 32:39.320
[Yuchun Opera House, Dream Seeking, Dream Waking, Xiao Tao Chun]

287
32:39.320 --> 32:41.139
You're humorous.

288
32:43.600 --> 32:45.340
What is she doing here?

289
33:06.520 --> 33:08.140
This is our girl's spot.

290
33:08.140 --> 33:09.560
When did you get to sit here?

291
33:09.560 --> 33:11.560
Open your stupid eyes!

292
33:13.800 --> 33:16.599
Who's the star here?

293
33:16.599 --> 33:19.900
I've had the stage for days.

294
33:19.900 --> 33:22.440
Your Lan Qing was a total dud.

295
33:22.440 --> 33:24.640
She's an absolute laughingstock.

296
33:24.640 --> 33:26.940
Lan Qing was just distracted for a moment.

297
33:26.940 --> 33:28.640
She'll sing properly next time.

298
33:28.640 --> 33:30.253
And who are you?

299
33:47.980 --> 33:51.386
- Bravo! - Bravo!

300
33:52.280 --> 33:55.713
- Bravo! - Bravo!

301
33:58.440 --> 33:59.900
Bravo!

302
33:59.900 --> 34:05.200
For opera singers, mistakes onstage are a cardinal sin.

303
34:05.200 --> 34:08.079
[The Star of Yuchun Changed Overnight] This time, it even made the papers.

304
34:08.079 --> 34:12.980
One more time, and your career is over.

305
34:17.360 --> 34:20.440
People lavish praise on performers and keep them fed.

306
34:21.560 --> 34:24.500
No different from keeping a cat or walking a dog.

307
34:26.560 --> 34:29.940
The gong sounds, the strings begin,

308
34:31.139 --> 34:34.260
and the moment someone else takes the stage, I'm forgotten.

309
34:40.440 --> 34:43.241
It really is fleeting.

310
34:58.840 --> 35:03.179
This is the one I picked after visiting several shops.

311
35:03.179 --> 35:06.119
Hope you like it.

312
35:07.720 --> 35:09.539
Chang Xuan, you're back.

313
35:24.880 --> 35:26.593
Why are you so nervous?

314
35:27.659 --> 35:30.800
You aren't hiding a knife under the pillow, are you?

315
35:34.420 --> 35:36.800
Why are you going to bed so early?

316
35:36.800 --> 35:40.199
Nothing. I'm just a little tired.

317
35:40.199 --> 35:44.440
I went to Laozhengxing and ordered their signature dishes.

318
35:44.440 --> 35:48.666
And an order of chicken soup dumplings.

319
35:50.400 --> 35:52.266
How did you know I like these?

320
35:58.320 --> 36:00.160
I bought them just for you.

321
36:00.160 --> 36:01.526
Try them.

322
36:02.200 --> 36:04.200
Do they taste like you remember?

323
36:05.520 --> 36:06.893
I'm a little tired.

324
36:07.480 --> 36:09.300
I don't have much appetite.

325
36:09.300 --> 36:11.440
You still need to eat, no matter how tired you are.

326
36:11.440 --> 36:12.880
Have some.

327
36:57.960 --> 36:59.766
You're pretty capable.

328
37:01.920 --> 37:04.533
You even managed to find this place.

329
37:07.579 --> 37:12.460
You hid here alone to brood over memories of him?

330
37:14.820 --> 37:18.760
No matter what, this belongs to me.

331
37:19.920 --> 37:21.520
Give it back to me.

332
37:43.760 --> 37:49.593
You talk to me like that just for his ring?

333
38:03.240 --> 38:04.740
How did you get that injury?

334
38:11.900 --> 38:13.920
Was it from looking for this ring?

335
38:23.320 --> 38:27.320
Didn't I tell you not to have anything belonging to other men?

336
38:27.320 --> 38:28.459
Let go.

337
38:29.659 --> 38:31.040
Let go.

338
38:40.200 --> 38:41.500
You never learn.

339
38:42.440 --> 38:44.559
I'll teach you a lesson.

340
38:44.559 --> 38:46.320
What are you doing, Yu Chang Xuan?

341
38:46.320 --> 38:47.739
What are you doing?

342
38:47.739 --> 38:50.139
Yu Chang Xuan, let go.

343
38:50.139 --> 38:51.320
Let go.

344
38:54.760 --> 38:56.060
Let go.

345
39:02.099 --> 39:03.179
Don't.

346
39:03.179 --> 39:04.480
Don't.

347
39:06.260 --> 39:07.559
I'm begging you.

348
39:08.440 --> 39:10.000
Don't touch me.

349
39:17.160 --> 39:18.740
Don't touch me.

350
41:11.400 --> 41:12.820
Master Chang Xuan, I found out.

351
41:12.820 --> 41:17.640
Her mother said her favorite food growing up was chicken soup dumplings from Laozhengxing.

352
41:26.480 --> 41:30.585
Yu Chang Xuan, what are you doing?

353
41:30.585 --> 41:35.616
[Maple Mansion]
